      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-hero\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto gap-8 pb-24 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\"><div class=\"kent-case-logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/kent-state-university/kent-state-logo-white.png\" alt=\"Kent State University\" width=\"362\" height=\"106\" decoding=\"async\"></div><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Higher education · SEO, PPC &amp; conversion design</p><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Kent State University</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">More interest. More enquiries.</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor max-w-prose\">A Fyntix growth programme for graduate business study.</p><nav class=\"kent-case-navigation\" aria-label=\"Case study sections\"><a href=\"#kent-state-university-overview\">Results overview</a><a href=\"#kent-state-university-approach\">Our approach</a><a href=\"#kent-state-university-results\">Year-by-year results</a><a href=\"#kent-state-university-measurement\">Measurement notes</a></nav></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-overview\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-6 max-md:py-4\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts kent-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Results overview</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Historical reporting · 2015–2019</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bw-dashboard-replay\" data-bw-replay hidden aria-label=\"Replay Kent State University charts\">Replay</button></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-dark\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-overall-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-overall-title\">Overall leads</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">135 percent increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"135\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">135</span>%</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">2017 vs. 2016</p><div class=\"sp-revenue-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Relative overall leads: 2016 index 100; 2017 index 235, a 135 percent increase. Zero baseline; 250-point scale.\"><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:80.0px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-ks-value=\"100\" data-ks-maximum=\"250\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">100</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">2016</p></div><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar sp-column-bar--current\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:188.0px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-ks-value=\"235\" data-ks-maximum=\"250\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">235</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">2017</p></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Zero baseline</span><span>Index scale: 250</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Relative index: 2016 = 100. Actual lead totals unavailable.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-roi-2017-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-roi-2017-title\">Reported ROI</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">6.4 times ROI</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"6.4\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">6.4</span>×</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">2017</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card kent-half sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-enrolments-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-enrolments-title\">Programme enrolments</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">10 or more enrolments</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"10\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">10</span>+</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">2019 · SEO-focused programmes</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card kent-half sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-roi-2019-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-roi-2019-title\">Reported ROI</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Nearly 3 times ROI</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Nearly </span><span data-bw-counter=\"3\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">3</span>×</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">2019</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-brief\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\"><div class=\"kent-case-copy\"><h2 class=\"font-normal text-4xl tracking-tight text-spark mb-8\">A clearer path to graduate study.</h2><p>At Fyntix, we brought search visibility, paid campaigns, content and conversion design together for Kent State University’s graduate business programmes.</p><p>Graduate study is a considered decision. Prospective students need to understand programme fit, compare their options and find a useful next step. Search creates an opportunity to answer those questions; the experience after the click gives that opportunity a direction.</p><p>Our focus connected discovery with enquiries, bringing the message, the landing page and the conversion experience into the same growth programme.</p></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-approach\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\"><div class=\"kent-case-copy\"><h2 class=\"font-normal text-4xl tracking-tight text-spark\">What we delivered.</h2><div class=\"kent-approach-grid\"><article class=\"kent-approach-card\"><h3>Programme intent</h3><p>We aligned search targeting with prospective graduate students. A useful programme journey begins with the decision someone is trying to make, so visibility and relevance need to work together.</p></article><article class=\"kent-approach-card\"><h3>Search and content</h3><p>We refined keywords on priority pages and strengthened audience-focused content. Clear explanations help a visitor connect a search question with a relevant programme and an understandable next step.</p></article><article class=\"kent-approach-card\"><h3>Paid search journeys</h3><p>We refined PPC targeting and landing pages. The search ad and the page it opens should support the same student decision, giving a campaign a coherent route from interest to enquiry.</p></article><article class=\"kent-approach-card\"><h3>Conversion design</h3><p>We created custom page templates in Drupal to support conversions. Page structure, useful information and clear enquiry routes help people act when they are ready to discuss their options.</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-results\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-12 max-md:py-6\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts kent-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Year-by-year results</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Percentage increases across the stated comparison periods</p></div></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card kent-half sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-2016-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-2016-title\">Traffic and Google Ads leads</h3><p class=\"kent-period\">2016 vs. 2015</p><ul class=\"sp-bars\"><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Search engine traffic</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">74% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"74\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">74</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:18.50000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"74\" data-ks-maximum=\"400\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Paid traffic</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">36% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"36\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">36</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:9.00000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"36\" data-ks-maximum=\"400\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Google Ads leads</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">366% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"366\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">366</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:91.50000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"366\" data-ks-maximum=\"400\"></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0%</span><span>+400% scale</span></div></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card kent-half sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"ks-2017-title\"><h3 id=\"ks-2017-title\">Enquiries across channels</h3><p class=\"kent-period\">2017 vs. 2016</p><ul class=\"sp-bars\"><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Overall leads</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">135% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"135\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">135</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:84.37500000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"135\" data-ks-maximum=\"160\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Organic leads</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">38% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"38\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">38</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:23.75000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"38\" data-ks-maximum=\"160\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Paid leads</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">148% increase</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"148\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">148</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:92.50000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-ks-value=\"148\" data-ks-maximum=\"160\"></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0%</span><span>+160% scale</span></div></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"kent-state-university-measurement\" class=\"kent-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\"><div class=\"kent-case-copy\"><h2 class=\"font-normal text-4xl tracking-tight text-spark mb-8\">Read each result in context.</h2><p>The figures cover different years and measures. Traffic comparisons describe visits; lead comparisons describe enquiries. Enrolments represent a later step in the student journey. Review each alongside its reporting period.</p><p>The overall-lead chart uses an index: 2016 is set to 100 and 2017 to 235. This expresses the reported percentage increase. Each year-over-year comparison has its own baseline.</p><p>“10+” and “nearly 3×” retain their reported qualifiers. Raw counts, campaign budgets, the ROI calculation and attribution details were not supplied with these results.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"kent-case-cta\">Book a free strategy call</a></div></section></div>"
    },
