ref=\"/work/brown-boys-motor-club/seo-growth\" class=\"case-study-item__link clickable-block block w-full no-underline text-inherit\"><div id=\"work-brown-boys-motor-club\" class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8 scroll-mt-72\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail bb-thumbnail relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-21-19 bg-charcoal\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brown Boys Motor Club: 510% more organic clicks and 142,000 search impressions in six months\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/dealership-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1650\" height=\"1650\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full rounded-2xl object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__shade\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__logo bb-thumbnail__logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/brown-boys-motor-club/brown-boys-logo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1491\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__results\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__metric\">510% more organic clicks</p><p class=\"smartrent-thumbnail__value\">142,000 search impressions · six months</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-normal text-2xl text-spark tracking-tight\">Brown Boys Motor Club</p><h3 class=\"font-normal text-3xl tracking-tight text-haze-900\">More discovery. Stronger local search.</h3></div><p class=\"font-normal text-haze-60 tracking-tight text-lg\">Six months of technical SEO, local visibility and buyer-focused content.</p></div></div></a></div></div></section></div>"
